{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-13358", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-13358", "text": "' Until one is measured, the zones below come off your age.'", "sha256": "a156bf4f04632fd1b5e59a5b1b1704c0bb39b43503453ae59e250428b1cb3052", "kind": "dart", "start": 13358, "end": 13418, "line": 351}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-13503", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-13503", "text": "'No measured ceiling yet'", "sha256": "04b96586ad1673e7fbfe1b41c3a90bc6cba49490ec91c3f646749c28c591ad03", "kind": "dart", "start": 13503, "end": 13528, "line": 354}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-13651", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-13651", "text": "'We only count a high reading the band held for 15 seconds while '\n'you were moving. A one-second spike is not a heart '\n'rate.'", "sha256": "0e0f7417bc5937e98370c9d40cd12ed6a01f61291be8d96edcecabb52030bbe4", "kind": "dart", "start": 13651, "end": 13827, "line": 358}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-14012", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-14012", "text": "'Wear the band for your normal hard sessions'", "sha256": "dd25196ed6fe98b4d1f391764b5f4be5d99d2c212513c9b0553b31121e4518ef", "kind": "dart", "start": 14012, "end": 14057, "line": 365}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-14681", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-14681", "text": "'HIGHEST WE HAVE SEEN'", "sha256": "14e2ea4585fc951cc860028efa2d01f779216fa5f281ca698cb72e0aa5022918", "kind": "dart", "start": 14681, "end": 14703, "line": 383}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-15563", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-15563", "text": "'The highest we have measured, not a limit — it creeps up as the '\n'band sees harder efforts. Do not go and test it.'", "sha256": "d27b6f969d8dbb3c4dcaf4a5e6405f4beecf6dc3523b368b7dca713b31a79211", "kind": "dart", "start": 15563, "end": 15700, "line": 406}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-16525", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-16525", "text": "'No zones yet'", "sha256": "e5f3f001f156417d421181384b32c65ee58559850d0a7af71efd321e03fe6a6f", "kind": "dart", "start": 16525, "end": 16539, "line": 426}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-16643", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-16643", "text": "'Zone edges are percentages of a maximum heart rate, and '\n'without your age there is nothing to take a percentage of.'", "sha256": "05bdcedfeb5402bcfe4eb88fe5353db96913448c9a803e0c27dbe443eef8f5f4", "kind": "dart", "start": 16643, "end": 16786, "line": 430}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-16865", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-16865", "text": "'Nothing recorded says why there are no zone edges yet.'", "sha256": "03ace0cedc0faa16cbfa80a293c287d9d9c5366d5ec1bf5d2a5a1d9f51b6ed83", "kind": "dart", "start": 16865, "end": 16921, "line": 433}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-16976", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-16976", "text": "'Add your age in Profile'", "sha256": "52eb26b4b1d7185c9a3e7e2ad164b0eca770aace632f8fdf6e4703073d02f68e", "kind": "dart", "start": 16976, "end": 17001, "line": 434}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-18923", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-18923", "text": "'Built from two numbers the band measured on you: your resting '\n'rate (${d.restingHr}, the middle of your last ${d.restingDays} '\n'nights) and the highest we have seen ($max). A low resting rate '\n'makes zone 1 wide. These are the usual bands, not your own '\n'measured thresholds.'", "sha256": "86ff27eff289f2569aab793d23f5756128c5cb47a892b3dd06858058e1a99546", "kind": "dart", "start": 18923, "end": 19269, "line": 493}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-19415", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-19415", "text": "'Built from the highest heart rate we have seen ($max). After '\n'${d.restingMinDays} nights of resting rate (you have '\n'${d.restingDays}) your resting rate joins it, which fits you '\n'better. These are the usual bands, not your own measured '\n'thresholds.'", "sha256": "44d731fe8a67839b880042a7eb1c3690ee32c4342b134042206655ce69d5cd14", "kind": "dart", "start": 19415, "end": 19736, "line": 501}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-19828", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-19828", "text": "'Built from $max bpm, estimated from your age rather than '\n'measured on you — it can be 20 bpm out either way. The edges move '\n'to a measured ceiling once the band sees a hard enough session.'", "sha256": "2e0d5daff652a1c3442f5aa48c7a95b2f586620999f138a7d5f8c782191b76c0", "kind": "dart", "start": 19828, "end": 20054, "line": 508}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-20136", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-20136", "text": "'Set by you, not computed — these five thresholds override '\n'whatever your age or a measured ceiling would have given you.'", "sha256": "63d843874d09535d0f9a3648d7f8c31e8b84d096a6efb9855b36ef173cc60a0c", "kind": "dart", "start": 20136, "end": 20276, "line": 513}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-20353", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-20353", "text": "'Zone edges are percentages of a maximum heart rate.'", "sha256": "9c7b60e2e074f8cbbd19ac8987d3098dd42fa364970ab406fa89b3c7503d485a", "kind": "dart", "start": 20353, "end": 20406, "line": 517}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-20852", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-20852", "text": "'Where your intensity went'", "sha256": "97ced1404e7d0bd6e06c06b39de822be530cd1ee3bca146acd35606d212f6459", "kind": "dart", "start": 20852, "end": 20879, "line": 529}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-20948", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-20948", "text": "'Not shown yet'", "sha256": "a784ca179d367287523a14b373c7eaafcac3f8cd2de2e75bef9dccda12d1430c", "kind": "dart", "start": 20948, "end": 20963, "line": 531}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-21392", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-21392", "text": "'Needs about a month of recorded sessions, each with a '\n'minute-by-minute heart rate.'", "sha256": "0edd47b7eb062854fad11694c266c9d9b4a4d045e27f014c47718c124d35ba0a", "kind": "dart", "start": 21392, "end": 21507, "line": 539}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-21591", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-21591", "text": "'The bars would be a picture of the age estimate, not of '\n'your training. They appear once the zone edges above '\n'are measured.'", "sha256": "d7e78c9d4609ae1b55d5dfc255b45b059d8cab1dba8d67366791191b4b414040", "kind": "dart", "start": 21591, "end": 21777, "line": 542}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-22026", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-22026", "text": "'Where your intensity went'", "sha256": "97ced1404e7d0bd6e06c06b39de822be530cd1ee3bca146acd35606d212f6459", "kind": "dart", "start": 22026, "end": 22053, "line": 554}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-22180", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-22180", "text": "'SESSION MINUTES, LAST 28 DAYS'", "sha256": "1ba8244077836de0b4faf21a4cb7d55f1829df7cf779b29d83932a7dc3c172e1", "kind": "dart", "start": 22180, "end": 22211, "line": 558}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-23175", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-23175", "text": "'Most of your minutes are easy, fewer in the middle, '\n'fewest hard — a pyramid.'", "sha256": "62346b8742d52334315037573b11085858722415c6c901649c931df4d6b282c1", "kind": "dart", "start": 23175, "end": 23270, "line": 585}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-23337", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-23337", "text": "'Most of your minutes are easy and the rest are hard, '\n'with little in between.'", "sha256": "bde7877ba75ee330900e67b54c5e6945c136932df889cf6ce0d87bf031273f1b", "kind": "dart", "start": 23337, "end": 23432, "line": 588}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-23504", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-23504", "text": "'Most of your minutes sit in the middle rather than '\n'easy or hard.'", "sha256": "ee4697cfdba50d0b94148aaa4c6c1396bcac64e094af9020ce18d17590e87200", "kind": "dart", "start": 23504, "end": 23587, "line": 591}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart:offset-23740", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/zones.dart", "location": "offset-23740", "text": "'${d.distEasy} min easy, ${d.distModerate} moderate, '\n'${d.distHard} hard, over ${d.distSessions} recorded sessions. A '\n'description, not a target.'", "sha256": "0e5dfb8d640549fe16f6827de2887824c2a6434d1303b41daa133d4db55ca414", "kind": "dart", "start": 23740, "end": 23914, "line": 597}
